  "notes": "Boot a Terminator 2 ROM from an empty NVRAM with the coin door open (public 22 released) and PinMAME's built-in mechanisms disabled; the scenario names no game. Leave the fresh-NVRAM loop with Escape (5), step past the TEST REPORT and game identification with Enter (8), go Up (7) twice to T. TESTS and Enter the test menu at T.1 SWITCH EDGES. Go Up to T.6 GENERAL ILLUMINATION and start it, then press Up 50 times with 1.5 s between presses, taking a DMD snapshot while each press is held: Up steps the selected string and its brightness, so the run records each string the ROM names and prints wires for, together with the public G.I. output it drives.",
  "version": 1
}
